cf_tick_schema.json in this directory is a verbatim copy of
https://raw.githubusercontent.com/regro/cf-scripts/4cec2cf621f8f257389368facb44769cfe422214/conda_forge_tick/cf_tick_schema.json
(the file's last change on cf-scripts main, 2026-09-27; copied 2026-10-22, mason Story 26.2).
CFE's tests point conda-smithy's CONDA_SMITHY_BOT_SCHEMA_URI at it, so they never fetch it.
